    "method": "Initially, the assay was performed according to the manufacturer’s instructions. However, because the measured optical density was too high, we optimized the assay by modifying three conditions: (1) sample incubation time: 1.5 hours instead of 2.5 hours; (2) HRP dilution: 1:300 instead of 1:120; (3) detection antibody dilution: 1:300 instead of 1:80. We also recommend diluting the samples from 1:2 to 1:16 using the assay diluent provided with the kit."
